<title>USA: Rotech Medical Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Rotech Medical Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ROTECH MEDICAL CORP.</p>
<p>				    Fiscal Year Results</p>
<p>			 (in thousands)  (in thousands)	    %</p>
<p>				    1996		1995    Increase</p>
<p> Operating Revenue	$ 263,030	 $ 134,111	  96%</p>
<p> Net Income		    20,555	    13,145	  56%</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share:</p>
<p>   Primary			 0.83		0.64	  30%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted		 0.82		0.64	  28%</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>Shares:</p>
<p>   Primary		     24,657	    20,684	  19%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted	     25,206	    21,054	  20%</p>
<p>				  Fourth Quarter Results	    %</p>
<p>				     1996		1995   Increase</p>
<p> Operating Revenue	$  83,461	 $  39,775	 110%</p>
<p> Net Income		     5,860	     3,998	  47%</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share:</p>
<p>   Primary			 0.23		0.17	  35%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted		 0.23		0.17	  35%</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>Shares:</p>
<p>   Primary		     25,565	    23,112	  11%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted	     25,940	    23,482	  10%</p>
<p>During the fiscal year ended July 31, 1996, RoTech added 165 home care locations, with 145 established through acquisitions and another 20 as new locations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
